WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
[Port sirens echoing in the distance]

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:12.000
Dock Master: The cargo shipment must be cleared before nightfall!

3
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Worker: We've been working twelve hours without a break.

4
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Deva: Stand together. No one exploitation lasts forever.

5
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:30.000
[Heavy footsteps approaching the warehouse]

6
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:37.000
Deva: If they want a fight, we give them a revolution.

7
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:44.000
[Intense cinematic background music builds up]
